{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"\nDMG - Volume 2: International Subjects  ","tree_line_end":4,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"\nChapter 07 Parts 1-7 ","tree_line_end":7,"tree_line_start":5},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"\nSummary of changes from November 2020 ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":8},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"May 2026 ","tree_line_end":12,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":13},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"DMG Memo 03/26: AA, CA, DLA (Care Component) - Competent State for Cash Sickness Benefits of Pensioners and their Family Members published. This memo gives guidance on the judgment in SE v SSWP, which was made by the Upper Tribunal on 5.12.2024 and is a relevant determination. ","tree_line_end":16,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Chapter 7 Part 2 updated with cross-referenced annotations to memo.   ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":17},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":20,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"April 2026 ","tree_line_end":22,"tree_line_start":21},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":24,"tree_line_start":23},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"DMG memo 10-25: HRT, PPT, and Temporary Absence Amendment Regulations 2025 updated following recent events in the Middle East. DMG Chapter 07 Parts 1-3 amended to reflect this change.  ","tree_line_end":26,"tree_line_start":25},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":28,"tree_line_start":27},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"December 2025 ","tree_line_end":30,"tree_line_start":29},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":32,"tree_line_start":31},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"DMG memo 13-25: “Any Time” Revision - Effect of Upper Tribunal Decision re-published as the following has been added to the end of para 8 for clarification – “Where the dispute is made after more than 13 months, …….”\n ","tree_line_end":35,"tree_line_start":33},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":36},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"November 2025 ","tree_line_end":39,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":41,"tree_line_start":40},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"DMG Memo 14-25: ‘SPC Right to Reside: VB v SSWP UT decision effect on Self Employment’ added with cross references to Chapters 07 Part 3 ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":42},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":45,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Chapter 07 Part 4.   ","tree_line_end":47,"tree_line_start":46},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Added new paragraphs at 074462-074478. This was needed because there it had been identified that there was no guidance about the historical IIDB reciprocal agreements between GB and NI, IoM, Jersey & Guernsey. ","tree_line_end":49,"tree_line_start":48},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":51,"tree_line_start":50},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"New DMG memo 12-25: Cross-Border Issues and Devolved Benefits added with cross references to the DMG Chapter 07 Part 2 paragraphs 071705 and 071726. ","tree_line_end":53,"tree_line_start":52},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":55,"tree_line_start":54},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"October 2025 ","tree_line_end":57,"tree_line_start":56},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":58},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"DMG Memo 11-25: Self-sufficiency and the Court of Appeal decision in WV. Memo refers to the ‘recent’ WV judgment at the Court of Appeal, which found that certain ","tree_line_end":61,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"EU/EEA nationals who rely on their partners’ legacy benefits may be considered as self-sufficient under specific circumstances and so potentially be entitled to Universal Credit (UC). Chapters 073244-073246 annotated. ","tree_line_end":63,"tree_line_start":62},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":65,"tree_line_start":64},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Chapter 2  ","tree_line_end":67,"tree_line_start":66},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Changes to incorporate DMG memo 02/25 DMG 04653 – 04655 – included the following paragraph and moved DMG the current 04653-54 down by 1 paragraph due to fit this in, the changes I have made are highlighted in red:\n ","tree_line_end":70,"tree_line_start":68},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"minor amends to correct typos. ‘\n ","tree_line_end":73,"tree_line_start":71},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":75,"tree_line_start":74},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":77,"tree_line_start":76},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"September 2025 updates ","tree_line_end":79,"tree_line_start":78},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":80},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Chapter 07 part 02 and part 03 ","tree_line_end":83,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":85,"tree_line_start":84},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"DMG Memo 10-25: “HRT, PPT, and Temporary Absence Amendment Regulations 2025 provide guidance on the Social Security (Habitual Residence, Past Presence and Temporary Absence) (Amendment) Regulations 2025, which came into force on 18.07.2025. Added with Chapters DMG 071707 – 071930 pt 02 also DMG 072770 - 073707 pt 03 for cross referencing ","tree_line_end":87,"tree_line_start":86},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":89,"tree_line_start":88},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":91,"tree_line_start":90},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Chapter 7 Part 2 ","tree_line_end":93,"tree_line_start":92},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":95,"tree_line_start":94},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"As a result of \nDMG Memo 07-24: Social Security Co-ordination between the UK, Ireland, Gibraltar, Switzerland, Iceland, Liechtenstein and Norway due to new social security orders that come into force between 2019 and 2024.  ","tree_line_end":98,"tree_line_start":96},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"  ","tree_line_end":100,"tree_line_start":99},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Abbreviations  ","tree_line_end":102,"tree_line_start":101},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"EU-UK-WA’ has been added to the Abbreviations list  ","tree_line_end":104,"tree_line_start":103},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":105},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Statutes and SI list  ","tree_line_end":108,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"The following Orders were added to the Statutes and SI list:  ","tree_line_end":110,"tree_line_start":109},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Social Security (Ireland) Order 2019 [SS (Ireland) Order 2019]  ","tree_line_end":112,"tree_line_start":111},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Social Security (Gibraltar) Order 2024 [SS (Gibraltar) Order 2024]  ","tree_line_end":114,"tree_line_start":113},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Social Security (Switzerland) Order 2021 [SS (Switzerland) Order 2021]  ","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":115},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Social Security (Iceland) (Liechtenstein) (Norway) Order 2023 [SS (Iceland) (Liechtenstein) (Norway)] Order 2023\n ","tree_line_end":119,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":120},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":123,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"May 2024 updates ","tree_line_end":125,"tree_line_start":124},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":126},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Chapter 7 Part 2 ","tree_line_end":129,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Correct inaccuracies caused when memo was incorporated. ","tree_line_end":131,"tree_line_start":130},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":" ","tree_line_end":133,"tree_line_start":132},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"April 2024 updates ","tree_line_end":135,"tree_line_start":134},{"de